树立“为人民服务”的思想，提升思想境界，端正工作作风，充分发挥党员的先锋模范带头作用。</spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"assets/ca124d170f1f1b1b8e100d37f0df9545b97bfac4cb258ac81389af5efbebef06.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"assets/812e7df7db1687e98616e23cc665ee60930c34ee4c81d617584b7fdfb2972426.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span><br></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p>\n                ",
